{"name":"race_autonz","seed":777,"config":{"rivalsByCount":true}}
# An autonz run (phase F step 5): New Expedition seed 777, the Race row
# stepped twice to the autonz. No ship; the run opens viewing the node on
# the start system (four wire placers and two enforcers, the cursor bound).
# The HUD is the autonz's (metal, crystal, ferrite, conversion; Lay Wire and
# Deploy Relay; Assimilation), a wire placer's unit modal shows its type and
# tier and no needs, a Lay Wire click queues a convert order, a Signal Core
# placed by the node (debug place) opens its panel (readiness, worlds in
# reach, Transmit here, the group toggles). Then the node aimed (debug aim:
# the director never spreads by itself), frozen and 200 days stepped by
# Tier 1: its signal has founded a second world of the
# player's. Frames: the race row, the node, the unit modal, the core's
# panel, the Star Map at day 200, the second world.
